										Join multiple award winning captive agent Joel Laird on <b>Wednesday, July 15, 2020 @ 2:00 PM Eastern (11:00 AM Pacific)</b> for a webinar presentation on <b>"Leadership: The Silver Bullet of an Agency AND Empowering Customers to Buy Life Insurance"</b> (2-part webinar) with Joel Laird (hosted by Chandler Hahn). Joel’s presentations will focus on two crucial areas agents should be focused on – leadership and increasing your overall sales of life insurance. Joel will discuss:
<ul>
<li>The importance of having a clearly articulated vision so your people know WHY their work matters</li>
<li>Why good leaders are always optimistic for the future, yet grounded in the here and now</li>
<li>How to simplify life insurance for customers to help them make informed decisions</li>
<li>Changing the life insurance conversation from money to time</li>
</ul>
Joel took over his first agency with his carrier back in 2008, and since then has forged a very successful career path. He inherited a team ranked in the bottom 5% of his company (#479 of 529) and within 3 years achieved a ranking in the top 10% (#40 of 529) company-wide.
									</td>
